fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstav1parser.html#GstAV1TileListOBU","fragment":"\n\tGstAV1TileListOBU\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.AV1TileListOBU\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.AV1TileListOBU\n\nMembers\nplus one is the width of the output frame, in tile units.\nplus one is the height of the output frame, in tile units.\nplus one is the number of tile_list_entry in the list. It is a requirement\nof bitstream conformance that tile_count_minus_1 is less than or equal to 511.\nplus one is the width of the output frame, in tile units.\nplus one is the height of the output frame, in tile units.\nplus one is the number of tile_list_entry in the list. It is a requirement\nof bitstream conformance that tile_count_minus_1 is less than or equal to 511.\nplus one is the width of the output frame, in tile units.\nplus one is the height of the output frame, in tile units.\nplus one is the number of tile_list_entry in the list. It is a requirement\nof bitstream conformance that tile_count_minus_1 is less than or equal to 511.\n"});